303
01:06:53,280 --> 01:07:04,160
of instruction that goes to HBM. This style is generically known as scratchpad instead of cache. The key distinction is that you have

304
01:07:04,160 --> 01:07:12,880
one kind of instruction that says "read or write scratchpad," and a totally different instruction that says "read or write HBM." So scratchpad being the cache.

